# WS2-11. # Sources: spec/05-statements.md §16 and spec/11 (E10021: a read before assignment on every path) and spec/03 §3 (E10020: a read after a move).
 spec/05 STMT-9: switch falls through (W10002); case 1 falls into case 2,
# so every path assigns a.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: output
contrast: let k: i32 = 1; ==> let k: i32 = 3;
contrast-expect: output
--- output
one
use 2
end
drop 2
--- contrast-output
use 9
end
drop 9
